    ["打开后随机获得1件<Highlight>66装等</>的<Highlight>竞技倾向</>橙色装备，有较低概率额外获得1件非绑的<Highlight>66装等</>的<Highlight>竞技倾向</>装备。"] = "Open to randomly receive 1 piece of <Highlight>66 item level</> <Highlight>Competition-oriented</> orange equipment, with a lower probability of additionally receiving 1 unbound piece of <Highlight>66 item level</> <Highlight>Competition-oriented</> equipment.",
