    ["每<Highlight>20进度</>获得1个养成资源箱，开启可随机获得一件<Highlight>68装等</>的<Highlight>竞技倾向</>橙色或金色品质装备，非凡物质、聚合因子、绑定苏勒。有一定概率额外获得一件符合秘宝装等的烙印装备，开启20次该秘宝后必定获得。有一定概率可获得1个灰雾晶砾（用于将64装等或以上装等竞技胸针升级至神话品质），每周至多获得3个，未获得的数量可累计至下周。"] = "Gain 1 Growth Resource Chest every <Highlight>20 progress</>. Opening it grants a random <Highlight>68 item level</> <Highlight>Competition-oriented</> orange or gold quality Equipment, Beyonder material, Polymerization Factor, or bound soli. There is a chance to additionally obtain a piece of Brand Equipment matching the Secret Treasure's item level; it is guaranteed after opening 20 of these Secret Treasures. There is a chance to obtain 1 Gray Fog Crystal (used to upgrade Competition Brooches of item level 64 or higher to Mythical quality). A maximum of 3 can be obtained per week, and unobtained amounts can be carried over to the following week.",
